From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:05:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Note 27: earning a look by reading (his yes to all,
 20:47)

docs/1.9-build/notes/build-95/earned-looks/prototype.patch, rebased on
notes 18 and 19: a goal is the look itself, lit, with its marks
(EarnMarks); a tap opens what is left to read (EarnSheet) in place of the
line under the row, so Settings' in-page move for that line goes, and the
moment it is earned shows on the last page read (EarnedMoment). The row
keeps GoalTile's contract (docs/handoffs/fable-looks.md, open item 3).
settings.paletteEarnCouncils and paletteEarnCappadocian, read by no screen
now, leave English; earned.test.ts holds the 13 earn.* lines in all 21
catalogs, which the languages commit brings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
